# …except the blank ACORD form the Certificate Master fills. The rule above
# exists to keep client documents off the public site, and it should: this
# is the one PDF that IS part of the app. Without this line the form 404s in
# production and no certificate can be generated, while everything looks
# fine locally — so add any future form here deliberately, never by relaxing
# the *.pdf rule.
